problem:
Trace the execution of the following Python code and determine the final value of 'total' that is printed at the end:

total = 0
i = 1
while i <= 3:
    j = 1
    while j <= 2:
        if (i + j) % 2 == 0:
            total = total + i
        else:
            total = total - j
        j = j + 1
    i = i + 1
print(total)
